    (ct1.1.trans ct2.1.symm) (ct1.2.trans ct2.2.symm) sl
 · simp only [bodyProgram,if_neg h] at leg
   simp only [A161Low4Select.squareEntry,if_neg h,toffoliCount_append,measurementCount_append,gateSlots_append]
